===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|bellen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|bellan||to bellow; make a hollow noise; roar; bark; grunt}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*bellaną||to sound; roar; bark}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bʰel-||to sound; roar; bark}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|bell||to shout; speak loudly}}, {{cog|nl|bellen||to ring}}, {{cog|nds-de|bellen||to ring}}, {{cog|de|bellen||to bark}}, {{cog|sv|böla||to low; bellow; roar}}.

